[center][size=6][b][color=#12a3b4]AN76 Toilets[/color][/b][/size]
[size=4]Your bladder has opinions. So does everyone else's.[/size][/center]

An add-on for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/58440]Advanced Needs 76[/url]'s bathroom needs: comedy sounds and voices, a HUD icon, accidents when you hold it too long, the world's toilets and urinals made usable, and NPCs who use them too.

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@2387e03c826431c257a2d3e9b98f207e9bd9d0e9/docs/img/accidents.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Accidents.[/b] Hold it until the clock turns red and nature wins: the conversation ends, the street cowers, screams and gags, and the aftermath lingers.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@2387e03c826431c257a2d3e9b98f207e9bd9d0e9/docs/img/npcs.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Everyone goes.[/b] Settlers and companions sit down, undress, go, and dress again: on the game's own toilets, AN76's, and ours. Children keep their clothes on.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@2387e03c826431c257a2d3e9b98f207e9bd9d0e9/docs/img/voices.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Every voice joins in.[/b] 8,110 voice files across all 540 vanilla voices, and a 61-clip soundboard in a man's and a woman's version.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@2387e03c826431c257a2d3e9b98f207e9bd9d0e9/docs/img/world.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]The world's toilets work.[/b] 15 kinds of vanilla toilet and urinal become seats you can use, broken ones included. Men can use the urinals.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@ec5427e2a561e4e57f6efd417f9e7e22b4927cf8/docs/img/kitchens.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]World kitchens.[/b] 355 dead stoves prep food like AN76's Prep Stove, and 42 espresso machines brew its Silt Bean coffee. Needs only AN76, not its Bathroom Needs.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@ec5427e2a561e4e57f6efd417f9e7e22b4927cf8/docs/img/leftovers.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Leftovers.[/b] Accidents leave evidence: AN76's pile, a wet stain that fades, puke; a toilet that won't flush gets a pile and sometimes a burnt magazine. All of it cleans itself up.[/center]

[size=4][b][color=#12a3b4]Everything else[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Accidents replace AN76's pain; one switch in MCM brings the pain back.
[*]A HUD icon (HUDFramework) that joins the status-icon row: yellow, orange, red.
[*]The aftermath: a lingering stink, gnats, aftershock farts, and nearby people gag or throw up.
[*]A clothes safety net: anything AN76's undress leaves off is put back on when you are done.
[*]Once per save, after you leave Vault 111, it starts AN76, its needs, Bathroom Needs and camping if they are not running. Anything you turn off in AN76's MCM afterwards stays off.
[*]Calmer needs, also once per save: hungry after 10 game hours (AN76: 6), thirsty after 7 (AN76: 4), the bathroom need 1 to 5 hours after a meal (AN76: up to 3). Change them in AN76's MCM and that stays.
[*]An MCM page for every part, plus a Testing page.
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#12a3b4]Requirements[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/58440]Advanced Needs 76[/url]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/20309]HUDFramework[/url]
[*]F4SE
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/21497]Mod Configuration Menu[/url] (for the settings)
[/list]
Fallout 4 1.10.163, Next-Gen or the Anniversary Edition. Install with Vortex or MO2: the installer checks your setup first. Manual installs are not supported.

[size=4][b][color=#12a3b4]Good to know[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]People undress to go: vanilla underwear, or nude if you use a body mod. Toilet humour, nothing sexual.
[*]Underground Hideout's toilet covers its whole bathroom, so that bathroom does not work. We don't patch other mods.
[*]A toilet another mod hides by shrinking it is skipped.
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#12a3b4]Credits[/color][/b][/size]
